SCOPE ORGANIZATION

TITLE

A governed project uses ONE ordered task list (state via status), not five
lists split by state. Task numbering must be a single standard sequence.

RAW_TEXT

Everything has a place and an order; a single list would be correct. And
"Fase 3" made no sense without a Phase 1 or 2 — the tasks must be one
ordered, standard sequence.

